From 6b021bdddd762d90f45e84575d165d856aafbc26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nyyks <janik.wyder@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:42:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: CloudDeck-Client agent tunnel on the paired-client
 HTTPS server

GET /clouddeck/v1/<op> with 'Upgrade: clouddeck-agent/1' on 47984 is relayed
to the host agent's Unix socket (/run/clouddeck-client/agent.sock), tagged
with the SHA-256 fingerprint of the verified client certificate. The agent's
answer becomes 101 + raw relay, 200 + JSON, or 502; 503 if no agent runs.
Only reachable after Sunshine's own client verification. Stock clients
never send Upgrade, so nothing changes for them.

Spec: CloudDeck-Client docs/adr/0006-usb-passthrough.md.
